  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/2 cup flaxseed meal",
    "2 tablespoon erythritol",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "4 large egg",
    "1/2 cup unsweetened carton coconut milk",
    "5 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "1 tablespoon coconut flour",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Add the almond flour, flaxseed, erythritol, salt, and baking powder in a mixing bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the dry ingredients together well, so that everything is evenly distributed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the eggs. Mix everything well to create a smooth liquid consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the coconut milk and four-fifths of the coconut oil. Mix to create a slightly more liquid consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the coconut flour and mix well. Add the spices to the mixture and mix until evenly distributed throughout the batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a skillet, heat up the butter and remaining coconut oil. Wait until the butter is beginning to bubble and turn brown. Add in about a quarter cup of pancake mix at a time. Try to cook these in batches of two — when I cooked three, they did not cook as evenly as I'd have liked.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the top begins to bubble, that side is ready. Flip the pancakes over with a spatula.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on the other side until browned and not falling apart.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/low-carb-almond-flour-flax-pancakes-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the pan and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-almond-flour-flaxseed-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-50677-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
